# SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
#
# Build output, libFuzzer's crash artifacts and the growing corpus. A crash worth keeping is
# minimised and committed under crashes/ with a note, by hand. Cargo.lock is tracked: `make
# clippy-fuzz` lints this workspace `--locked`, so its verdict is a function of the commit.
target
artifacts
corpus
coverage
# Written into the working directory when a target binary is run directly rather than
# through `cargo fuzz run`.
crash-*
oom-*
timeout-*
slow-unit-*
